0..78 Comment "//! State\'s models over host types. `get`\'s continuation binds the state, so a"
79..159 Comment "//! model gives it the thunked function from the state to the carrier, `+U (S ->"
160..237 Comment "//! -F C)`: in the standard model of a second-order signature a representable"
238..317 Comment "//! sort\'s binder is an exponential [Fiore-2010-second_order_equational_logic]."
318..392 Comment "//! The model here is state passing, the carrier a function of the current"
393..463 Comment "//! state. A law relating terms at `get`\'s port is a path between host"
464..519 Comment "//! functions, which the derivation does not state yet:"
520..599 Comment "//! `../../pathological/effects/state-model.gandr`. A model is a record, so one"
600..670 Comment "//! carried along an equivalence of states is a model again, its `get`"
671..705 Comment "//! conjugated by the equivalence."
706..709 Comment "//!"
710..740 Comment "//! - see: #2421 — `carried`"
741..796 Comment "//! - cites: [Fiore-2010-second_order_equational_logic]"
797..800 Comment "//!"
801..940 Comment "//! [Fiore-2010-second_order_equational_logic]: https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-15205-4_26 \"Fiore and Hur, Second-Order Equational Logic\""
